DocumentComment: <text>Reconstructed on 2026-10-27, after release. Built from tag 2026.10.2 of NabuCasa/aux-2 with the inputs its original CI build used: ESPHome dev 01524a2ffde8ddfab9b8d6d1e892408292227769, ESP-IDF 5.5.6, w5500_link_monitor from NabuCasa/aux-2 at 655357f24b8837ea5f965fdf9fdfd3273256c3d8. The rebuilt firmware matches the published signed firmware (https://firmware.nabucasa.com/aux-2/2026.10.2/firmware-esp32s3.factory.bin, sha256 7456c0eb91e5bcadf59020acd5eec41d4ff109b60a1f3ad2897231da14710fa6) byte for byte except for the embedded build time and the hashes that cover it. Apache NimBLE is listed only as a submodule of the ESP-IDF bt component: this firmware uses the Bluedroid host and compiles no NimBLE code, so CVE-2026-45812 and CVE-2026-45813 are recorded as not affected (component_not_present).</text>
