PackageName: Apache Mynewt Nimble
PackageSummary: <text>An open-source Bluetooth 5.1 stack with additional features and patches from Espressif.</text>
SPDXID: SPDXRef-SUBPACKAGE-bt-host-nimble-nimble
PackageVersion: 1.6.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
